{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "5cc5593a-ba68-892a-8569-4422b8ff26c0",
  "created_at": "2026-02-18T13:52:35-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Maria Vieira",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T13:50:42-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Denise."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T13:50:45-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, um, hello? I'm calling about a streetlight? It's right outside my house and it's, like, really bright?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T13:50:52-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Is it staying on all day, or is it flickering, or just too bright at night?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T13:50:58-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Just at night? It's not flickering or anything? It shines straight into my bedroom window, so, the whole room is lit up? Even with the blinds shut?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T13:51:08-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. And where are you located?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T13:51:11-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's 423 Ocean Avenue? On the Ocean Drive side?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T13:51:15-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "423 Ocean Avenue. Do you know if the pole has a number on it? Sometimes there's a little tag on it, about eye level."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T13:51:24-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Um, I didn't look? Hold on, I'm kind of, I can go out. Actually, can I just ask for a crew to check the pole? Like to see if something's wrong with it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T13:51:36-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, I can put in a request for a crew to look at it. If you do find a number later, call back and we'll add it, but the address is enough to start."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T13:51:48-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, great? And I tried the phone menu first? I'm basically on a first-name basis with it at this point?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T13:51:55-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "[pause] Ha, it does get around. Sorry about that. Let me make sure I have this right. Streetlight in front of 423 Ocean Avenue, too bright, shining into a bedroom window, crew to check the pole."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T13:52:08-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, exactly? That's it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T13:52:10-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Do you want a call back when it's done, or just have them handle it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T13:52:16-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A call back is fine? It's 401-555-0157?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T13:52:19-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0157. Perfect. It'll go on the list for this week or next, depending on what else is in front of it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T13:52:27-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, thank you? That's all I needed?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T13:52:30-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Maria. Have a good afternoon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T13:52:33-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too? Bye?"
    }
  ],
